!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
!
! Absorption cross-section CHBr3: CHBr3 + hv --> products
! source : JPL-2006 (no change with respect to JPL-2002)
! http://www.atmosphere.mpg.de/enid/2295
! -> Catalogue -> "Halogeno-alkanes, -alkyl radicals" -> "C+H+Br" -> "CHBr3" -> "JPL-2002"
! Rem1: Quantum yield = 1. Nevertheless, JPL-2006 reports nonvanishing values
!       for another branch (Br2 + CHBr)
! Rem2: Temperature influence:
!       290-362nm: T dep. according to the formula:
!           crs = exp(0.06183 - 0.000241*wl)*(T-273) - (2.376+0.14757*wl)
!       The cross sections are computed thanks to this formula
!       in subroutine CRS_TDEP.
!       !!!!BE CAREFUL!!!!
!       ===> Accordingly, the values provided below are not used. There are given only for info.
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Begins at wl interval :        44  | Finishes at wl interval :  104
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
